Dear NATASHA,

We would like to invite you to participate to our Amadeus Customer Operations comprehensive survey to help us understand your operational expectations and improve the way we serve and support your business. 

The survey will take less than 10 minutes of your time, and you can expect questions around delivery and implementation, learning, claims, support and the overall experience with Amadeus Service Hub.

Your feedback and improvement suggestions play a crucial role in shaping the future of our products and services. By sharing your feedback, you directly influence the development and enhancement of what we offer, ensuring that our solutions are aligned with your expectations and preferences.

We value your feedback and look forward to hearing from you!

Begin Survey: https://survey2.medallia.eu/?ethymwx9pw68k6b7pyb9

Your Amadeus Customer Operations Team

-------------------------------------------------------------
Privacy Policy [https://amadeus.com/en/policies/business-privacy-policy]

Unsubscribe [https://survey2.medallia.eu/?ethymwx9pw68k6b7pyb9&reject=begin]

This survey invitation will expire on June 24, 2025 at 8:00 AM.

If you have any questions about this process please contact your Account Management team. To enhance the quality of the services we provide to you, Amadeus IT Group S.A (Amadeus) is collecting some of your personal data, including your answers to the questions in this survey. We may share this data with third party providers whose services are needed to make this survey possible, and within the Amadeus Group. [https://amadeus.com/en]

You can access, review, erase and restrict the processing of your personal data by contacting Amadeus. [mailto:dataprotection@amadeus.com]

You are entitled to file a claim or complaint before the relevant data protection authorities if the answer provided by Amadeus does not meet your expectations. For more information, please visit our Business Partner's Privacy Policy. [https://amadeus.com/en/policies/business-privacy-policy]

